     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ahip-demo-additional-military-period</b></p><a name=\"ahip-demo-additional-military-period\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-demo-additional-military-period\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Language: en</p></div><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-military-period</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">P0911<a name=\"ahip-demo-additional-military-period-P0911\"> </a></td><td>September 2001 or later (Post 9/11)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">GULFW<a name=\"ahip-demo-additional-military-period-GULFW\"> </a></td><td>August 1990 through August 2001 (including the Persian Gulf War)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Y7590<a name=\"ahip-demo-additional-military-period-Y7590\"> </a></td><td>June 1975 through July 1990</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">VIETN<a name=\"ahip-demo-additional-military-period-VIETN\"> </a></td><td>August 1964 through May 1975 (including the Vietnam War)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Y5564<a name=\"ahip-demo-additional-military-period-Y5564\"> </a></td><td>February 1955 through July 1964</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">KOREA<a name=\"ahip-demo-additional-military-period-KOREA\"> </a></td><td>June 1950 through January 1955 (including the Korean War)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Y4750<a name=\"ahip-demo-additional-military-period-Y4750\"> </a></td><td>January 1947 through May 1950</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">WWII<a name=\"ahip-demo-additional-military-period-WWII\"> </a></td><td>December 1941 through December 1946 (including World War II)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">PRE41<a name=\"ahip-demo-additional-military-period-PRE41\"> </a></td><td>November 1941 or earlier</td></tr></table></div>"
